<title>BELGIUM: Coreper to resume directive talks Friday.</title>
<headline>Coreper to resume directive talks Friday.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Committee of Permanent Representatives did not finalise its position on Wednesday for next Wednesday's conciliation meeting on the television without frontiers directive due to lack of time, diplomats said.</p>
<p>They will continue their discussion on the issue on Friday afternoon from 1600 (1400 GMT), they said.</p>
</text>
